{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105215","id":2449468590,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6R_-yu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105215","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105215.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105215.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105215","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105215/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105215/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105215/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/631283e4135eafbc9f80e3ba2aeb05cfe4c98c12","number":105215,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Expose `object.get_class_name()`. Deprecate `object.get_class()`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`get_class` is a method that returns the class name of an `Object` as `String`. It simply calls another (not exposed) function called `get_class_name` which does the same but returns the name as `StringName`. This discards information,  makes things unnecessarily slow for callers needing a `StringName`, and essentially duplicates the function.\r\n\r\nIn an attempt to de-duplicate functionality, I exposed `get_class_name` and removed `get_class`. It would have been possible to change the return type of `get_class`, but I prefer the name `get_class_name` because it's returning the name, not a higher order class type.\r\n\r\nThe rest of the changes in this PR are pretty trivial; it's basically a big old search and replace changing instances of `get_class` to `get_class_name`.\r\n\r\n@Repiteo I've got a special question to you: It seems I'm the first person to attempt to use `[[deprecated]]` in the repository. I'm using your new macros, which are great, but it still ended up somewhat verbose. Got any suggestions?\r\n\r\nEdit: Turned to draft because the semantics of the new function should probably be discussed before exposing, see comments below.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"